# Habr Cover Style

For Movie Planner Habr article covers, use a deterministic graphic template, not cinematic AI art.

Use the house style from the reference covers:

- 800x440 PNG.
- Dark burgundy to navy gradient background.
- Small Movie Planner brand block at top left: app icon or simple popcorn mark plus "Movie Planner".
- Large centered bold white Russian headline, split into 1-2 lines.
- Short muted subtitle below the headline.
- Bottom pipeline with rounded pills: "Запрос" -> "LLM" -> the verified source or Movie Planner, with a green check on the last pill.
- Small muted footer line with compact keywords.
- No robots, no 3D scenes, no poster collage, no photorealistic cinema room, no generic neural-network decoration.
- Text must be real rendered text from a local font, not generated text inside an AI image.

Prefer updating `tools/build_habr_cover.py` and regenerating the PNG over using image generation.
